>> * Cyanide capsules kill you unless you are poison resistant.
>
> I second David on that. Maybe a STR loss or some usual poison effect  
> (between stat loos and death, decided at swallowing time) would be better  
> (after all, there is no scroll of instadeath, so read-iding scrolls is  
> doable).

This doesn't make swallow-IDing pills impossible, it just means you need
poison resistance; Nethack already has a lot of things that instakill
you if you don't have poison resistance, and many of them are harder to 
avoid than not swallowing random pills you find on the ground. 

My objection to this would be less that it is too harsh and more that it
is binary; I think it should have a _chance_ of killing you without poison
resistance, and even with poison resistance should have some potential
negative effects. As it stands, it sounds like poison resistance makes
this pill not a problem at all, and most bad items (scroll of punishment,
amnesia, fire, and so on) can't be jsut ignored by having foo resistance.

But I haven't actually played with the patch, so who am I to talk? :)

